WEBVTT

00:04:29.724 --> 00:04:31.017
and disclosure.

00:04:31.642 --> 00:04:36.939
Disclosure is the key to this systemic
and intergenerational problem.

00:04:38.816 --> 00:04:40.943
Speaking from my personal experience,

00:04:40.985 --> 00:04:43.738
the journey to embracing a disability

00:04:43.738 --> 00:04:44.905
is painful.

00:04:46.324 --> 00:04:48.743
It's like coming out of the closet

00:04:48.743 --> 00:04:52.330
or sharing a story of sexual assault.

00:04:54.707 --> 00:04:58.753
It forces us to revisit the hidden past

00:04:58.753 --> 00:05:00.880
or confront an uncertain future.